{"id":"treinta","lemma":"treinta","pos":"num","rank":1909,"glosses":["thirty"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾeinta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-treinta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Casi tengo treinta años.","en":"I'm almost thirty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443475"},{"text":"Ahora tengo treinta años.","en":"I am 30 years old now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44751"},{"text":"Hace ya treinta años.","en":"It's already been thirty years.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688402"},{"text":"Todavía tienes treinta minutos.","en":"You've still got thirty minutes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552161"},{"text":"Necesitaremos treinta dólares extra.","en":"We'll need an extra thirty dollars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/634319"}]}